  "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "48\nThe resistance of platinum wire at 0°C is 2Ω and 6.8Ω at 80°C. The temperature coefficient of\nresistance of the wire is :\n(1)\n3×10⁻¹ °C⁻¹\n(2)\n3×10⁻⁴ °C⁻¹\n(3)\n3×10⁻³ °C⁻¹\n(4)\n3×10⁻² °C⁻¹\n\n1\n2\n1\nR\n​−R\n​\n2\n1\nα =\n​ =\n2×80\n6.8−2\n​ =\n160\n4.8\n0.03 °C\n=\n−1\n3 × 10\n °C\n−2\n−1\n",
